{"name": "Decklings", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tame magical creatures called <strong>Decklings</strong> and lead them into challenging battles in this survival deck-building card game. Explore wild biomes, gather resources, cook nourishing meals, and craft to build your base as you shape your path to become the Deckling Champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"156\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/e8fcf8051fa1f8ccf9b80c9d8e3f6395.avif?t=1784746176\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore unique islands with diverse biomes, resources, and unique Decklings to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tame wild Decklings to grow your collection, featuring over 100 unique creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Deckling has unique abilities and move sets that can be learned as they level up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your Decklings to learn new moves or upgrade existing ones to enhance their decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728Hunt rare holo Decklings scattered across different biomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/224a7723716d94d51463d79489d89817.poster.avif?t=1784746176\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/224a7723716d94d51463d79489d89817.webm?t=1784746176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/224a7723716d94d51463d79489d89817.mp4?t=1784746176\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"156\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/1e35f42811d33a5a940459b48fc7609b.avif?t=1784746176\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle other tamers in 3x3 card duels on your path to becoming the Deckling Champion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try different team combinations and explore their synergies to defeat your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat other guilds and collect their flags as you rise through the ranks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your base against invasions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/cce5ead0a05b8f7c94daf54849bf15c7.poster.avif?t=1784746176\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/cce5ead0a05b8f7c94daf54849bf15c7.webm?t=1784746176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/cce5ead0a05b8f7c94daf54849bf15c7.mp4?t=1784746176\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"156\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/b811e486e0e68675d0bf88b9fa6b0062.avif?t=1784746176\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stack cards to craft all sorts of items, including food, equipment, and stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn new recipes as you progress on your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft equipment and items to get special bonuses and buffs in battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook delicious meals to feed your Decklings to keep the team together, or they might run away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automate your production building plantation fields, logging sites, feeders, and much more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/07c54c17bfebdcc7af449d89d78d5644.poster.avif?t=1784746176\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/07c54c17bfebdcc7af449d89d78d5644.webm?t=1784746176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/07c54c17bfebdcc7af449d89d78d5644.mp4?t=1784746176\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Tame magical creatures called Decklings and lead them into challenging battles in this survival deck-building card game. Explore wild biomes, gather resources, and craft to build your base as you shape your path to become the Deckling Champion.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/a580a7de83481e2d2c117786dfe86dc8473ed391/header.jpg?t=1784746176", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Creature Collector", "Deckbuilding", "Card Battler", "Strategy", "Turn-Based Combat", "Management"], "developers": "Dark Lizard Games", "publishers": "Dark Lizard Games", "release_date": "Sep 25, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3715790", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "cur